    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113366" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰράκ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>palisaded enclosure, entrenched camp.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.2.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρακώματα πρὸ τῆς πόλεως βαλέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>palisade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.2.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. καὶ τείχη καὶ τάφροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					6.23
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of the eyelashes, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				658b18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= Lat. <i>vallum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.3.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. διπλᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					10.31.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
